<title>UK: SOCCER-LEICESTER WIN ENGLISH LEAGUE CUP.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-LEICESTER WIN ENGLISH LEAGUE CUP.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leicester beat Middlesbrough 1-0 in extra time to win the replay of the English League Cup final on Wednesday.</p>
</text>
